<title>USA: NYMEX Energy Futures July 4 holiday hours.</title>
<headline>NYMEX Energy Futures July 4 holiday hours.</headline>
<text>
<p>THURSDAY July 3:</p>
<p>-- Palo Verde electricity futures and options will close at 1255 EDT/1655 GMT.  California-Oregon Border (COB) electricity futures and options will close at 1300 EDT/1700 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Crude oil, heating oil, gasoline, and natural gas futures will close at 1300 EDT/1700 GMT</p>
<p>FRIDAY July 4:</p>
<p>Exchange closed.</p>
<p>((-- New York Energy Desk +1 212 859 1620))</p>
</text>
